      "text": "What the heck was that?"
    },
    {
      "timestampSeconds": 6102,
      "text": "I think he's out of bullets."
    },
    {
      "timestampSeconds": 6104,
      "text": "It's because"
    },
    {
      "timestampSeconds": 6106,
      "text": "the other guy has no gun."
    },
    {
      "timestampSeconds": 6108,
      "text": "So he's like,"
    },
    {
      "timestampSeconds": 6389,
      "text": "Why are there friends here though?"
    },
    {
      "timestampSeconds": 6393,
      "text": "Oh, he's so used to it though."
    },
    {
      "timestampSeconds": 6413,
      "text": "It's like a staple gun"
    },
    {
      "timestampSeconds": 6415,
      "text": "to put your room back together,"
    },
    {
      "timestampSeconds": 6417,
      "text": "I think, probably."
    },
    {
      "timestampSeconds": 6425,
      "text": "He's like, you need someone to adopt you?"
    },
    {
      "timestampSeconds": 6427,
      "text": "Can I take them all?"
    },
    {
      "timestampSeconds": 6429,
      "text": "He's like, I need another dog."
    },
    {
      "timestampSeconds": 6439,
      "text": "I really liked Daisy."
    },
    {
      "timestampSeconds": 6441,
      "text": "This one's"
    },
    {
      "timestampSeconds": 6443,
      "text": "gonna be Peach."
    },
    {
      "timestampSeconds": 6445,
      "text": "Oh, he's so helpful."
    },
    {
      "timestampSeconds": 6447,
      "text": "Peach."
    },
    {
      "timestampSeconds": 6452,
      "text": "Look at his little paws."
    },
    {
      "timestampSeconds": 6454,
      "text": "Yeah, yeah,"
    },
    {
      "timestampSeconds": 6460,
      "text": "I think that's it."
    },
    {
      "timestampSeconds": 6473,
      "text": "Yeah, it's credits now."
    },
    {
      "timestampSeconds": 6475,
      "text": "That was pretty sick."
    },
    {
      "timestampSeconds": 6477,
      "text": "Damn it, Peach."
    },
    {
      "timestampSeconds": 6479,
      "text": "It ended for me."
    },
    {
      "timestampSeconds": 6481,
      "text": "It's over!"
    },
    {
      "timestampSeconds": 6487,
      "text": "The dog was scheduled to be put down, I think."
    },
    {
      "timestampSeconds": 6489,
      "text": "That puppy."
    },
    {
      "timestampSeconds": 6491,
      "text": "So that's why he took the puppy."
    },
    {
      "timestampSeconds": 6650,
      "text": "I didn't mind it so much."
    },
    {
      "timestampSeconds": 6652,
      "text": "Yeah, I agree."
    },
    {
      "timestampSeconds": 6654,
      "text": "I think it's okay."
    },
    {
      "timestampSeconds": 6656,
      "text": "I like the parts where he was happy."
    },
    {
      "timestampSeconds": 6658,
      "text": "I think I would like to"
    },
    {
      "timestampSeconds": 6660,
      "text": "cut everything else but the part"
    },
    {
      "timestampSeconds": 6662,
      "text": "where he was just happy with the dog."
    },
    {
      "timestampSeconds": 6664,
      "text": "The cereal part"
    },
    {
      "timestampSeconds": 6666,
      "text": "and the bed part."
    },
    {
      "timestampSeconds": 6672,
      "text": "It could be a 3 minute movie"
    },
    {
      "timestampSeconds": 6674,
      "text": "and it would be good."
    },
    {
      "timestampSeconds": 6676,
      "text": "Yeah."
    },
    {
      "timestampSeconds": 6680,
      "text": "The choreography was so well done."
    },
    {
      "timestampSeconds": 6682,
      "text": "It was very natural."
    },
    {
      "timestampSeconds": 6684,
      "text": "It looked like a dance."
    },
    {
      "timestampSeconds": 6692,
      "text": "But I'm devastated about Marcus and the dog."
    },
    {
      "timestampSeconds": 6694,
      "text": "Yeah."
    },
    {
      "timestampSeconds": 6696,
      "text": "And the Harry."
    },
    {
      "timestampSeconds": 6705,
      "text": "Are you guys okay?"
    },
    {
      "timestampSeconds": 6707,
      "text": "I didn't cry."
    },
    {
      "timestampSeconds": 6709,
      "text": "I cried."
    },
    {
      "timestampSeconds": 6711,
      "text": "It's sad because you know Daisy"
    },
    {
      "timestampSeconds": 6713,
      "text": "and they loved each other so much"
    },
    {
      "timestampSeconds": 6715,
      "text": "and Daisy was so important."
    },
    {
      "timestampSeconds": 7026,
      "text": "Liquorice please."
    },
    {
      "timestampSeconds": 7028,
      "text": "Black liquorice please."
    },
    {
      "timestampSeconds": 7030,
      "text": "No no no liquorice."
    },
    {
      "timestampSeconds": 7032,
      "text": "Ah"
    },
    {
      "timestampSeconds": 7036,
      "text": "Bijou."
    },
    {
      "timestampSeconds": 7040,
      "text": "I think I have something."
    },
    {
      "timestampSeconds": 7042,
      "text": "Sunday stream."
    },
    {
      "timestampSeconds": 7044,
      "text": "Minecraft was supposed to be a solo stream."
    },
    {
      "timestampSeconds": 7046,
      "text": "It is no longer a solo stream because I convinced"
    },
    {
      "timestampSeconds": 7048,
      "text": "Kyla to"
    },
    {
      "timestampSeconds": 7050,
      "text": "stream with me."
    },
    {
      "timestampSeconds": 7057,
      "text": "She built me something"
    },
    {
      "timestampSeconds": 7059,
      "text": "there."
    },
    {
      "timestampSeconds": 7061,
      "text": "She's going to show me."
    },
    {
      "timestampSeconds": 7063,
      "text": "Zen lost recovery arc"
    },
    {
      "timestampSeconds": 7065,
      "text": "because recently I Zen lost."
    },
    {
      "timestampSeconds": 7067,
      "text": "I died and lost"
    },
    {
      "timestampSeconds": 7069,
      "text": "a lot of stuff."
    },
    {
      "timestampSeconds": 7071,
      "text": "I died for a llama."
    },
    {
      "timestampSeconds": 7073,
      "text": "I died to save a llama's life"
    },
    {
      "timestampSeconds": 7075,
      "text": "and that llama is alive"
